# One line per ROS 2 release: <distro> <package> <base image digest> [<version>].
# The base digest pins the image the build and the reproducers run in. The
# version, when given, is the ros-<distro>-<package> source version (such as
# 2.14.7-1noble) the build patches and the reproducers test as stock; the ROS
# repository can ship a newer Fast DDS before any base image carries it
# (Jazzy's 2.14.7, synced after the newest ros:jazzy-ros-base was built), and
# then both install it from the repository first, as the binary whose version
# starts with it (the build stamp after it differs per architecture). Without
# one, the version is the one the base image carries. Refresh either together
# with a patch directory for the new upstream version (patches/<upstream>/).
humble fastrtps sha256:1813d3c85d7f96ff7d3012d865204583255740182db5d0065f8f8cd029a83138
jazzy fastrtps sha256:c3706ef0a0aa45413c07803cf433602f543b22e45b4855f6fca955c2d8ecc4e8 2.14.7-1noble
lyrical fastdds sha256:0c19f326a339ed770ef1d4c0646a8b53bdb49dd5ff74b6de41ebdb8ac21e1806
